# DERIVED from a live observation, not a raw capture: BlueMind on the rig (server 2), OPTIONS on
# /dav/calendars/__uids__/<owner uid>/exo-cal-<anchor>/ and on /dav/, reported by the EXO-90253 coordinator
# on 2026-09-14 around 18:55. Observed unauthenticated: HTTP/2 204, server: nginx, vary: Origin, and no dav
# or allow header; a CORS-style OPTIONS got the same bare 204. The authenticated answer was not observed on the
# rig, but dev/golden-capture/capture-bluemind.sh (step 1/6, which sends credentials) notes the same bare 204 on
# /dav/. BlueMind's own DAV server would answer 200 with both headers (plugins/net.bluemind.dav.server/src/net/
# bluemind/dav/server/proto/options/OptionsProtocol.java, write()), so the 204 is answered in front of it. What
# answers it (the rig's nginx include, a CORS rule) is deployment-specific and not in BlueMind's public source.
# Lines starting with "#" are removed by the test before parsing.
HTTP/2 204
server: nginx
vary: Origin

